# Build status — {{name}}

Every capability carries one label. Update a row when its state changes, and only mark it
`IMPLEMENTED` when a test exercises the real behaviour.

| Label | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `IMPLEMENTED` | Real behaviour, covered by a test |
| `MOCK` | Runs against a fake (the mock model, recorded fixtures); not evidence of quality |
| `STUB` | Placeholder that returns example data |
| `REQUIRES_AUTH` | Implemented, but untested without a credential |
| `UNSUPPORTED` | Not available in this project |

